            "open_state_header_bg": "#fefaff",
            "open_state_header_text": "#000000",
            "open_state_row_icon": "#1a237e",
            "open_state_collapse_icon": "#1a237e",
            "open_state_collapse_icon_solid": "#ffffff",
            "open_state_collapse_bg": "#1a237e",
            "open_state_content_bg": "#fefaff",
            "open_state_content_text": "#121212",
            "content": "<p>We designed this for zero-stress installation—no drilling, no hardwiring, and no electrician required.</p><ul><li><strong>Step 1: Plug It In.</strong> Simply plug the device directly into any standard wall outlet.</li><li><strong>Step 2: Auto-Calibration.</strong> Wait a few moments as the device performs an automatic self-test and calibrates to your room's air quality.</li><li><strong>Step 3: 24/7 Protection.</strong> Leave it to monitor your home round-the-clock.<br/><strong>Placement Tip:</strong> For optimal safety, place units near high-risk areas such as the kitchen, gas boiler, fireplace, and hallways outside bedrooms.</li></ul>",
            "page": "",
            "margin_top": 0,
            "margin_bottom": 0
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
