            "open_state_collapse_bg": "#1a237e",
            "open_state_content_bg": "#fefaff",
            "open_state_content_text": "#121212",
            "content": "<p><strong>Absolute Peace of Mind:</strong> Users sleep better knowing a reliable, CE-certified \"silent guard\" is protecting their loved ones from invisible threats 24/7.</p><p><strong>No More Guesswork:</strong> The dynamic digital screen removes the anxiety of wondering what a flashing green light means. You see the actual air safety numbers, room temperature, and humidity at a glance.</p><p><strong>Rental Compliance Made Easy:</strong> Airbnb and property hosts consistently rely on our detector to effortlessly meet local safety regulations and protect their guests without dealing with complex, permanent installations.</p>",
