    "faq_section": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "faq_1": {
          "type": "collapsible-row-content",
          "settings": {
            "open": false,
            "heading": "How is this detector different from standard CO alarms?",
            "icon": "check_box",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>Most traditional detectors only sound an alarm when gas concentrations reach dangerous levels (e.g., 70 ppm), meaning you have already been exposed for hours. Our device features a real-time digital display starting at 0 ppm, allowing you to see rising threats <em>before</em> they become an emergency.</p>",
            "page": ""
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "faq_2": {
          "type": "collapsible-row-content",
          "settings": {
            "open": false,
            "heading": "Are the sensors really professional-grade?",
            "icon": "check_box",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>Yes. This product utilizes the same high-accuracy sensor technology trusted by emergency first responders and fire departments. It is rigorously tested and fully CE-certified to meet the strictest European safety standards (EN 50291 and EN 50194).</p>",
            "page": ""
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "faq_3": {
          "type": "collapsible-row-content",
          "settings": {
            "open": false,
            "heading": "What types of gases does it actually detect?",
            "icon": "check_box",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>It is a comprehensive 4-in-1 safety device. It continuously monitors your air for invisible, odorless Carbon Monoxide (CO), as well as combustible gases like Natural Gas and Propane (LPG). It also displays real-time room temperature and humidity.</p>",
            "page": ""
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "faq_4": {
          "type": "collapsible-row-content",
          "settings": {
            "open": false,
            "heading": "Where are the best places to install it?",
            "icon": "check_box",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>For optimal protection, we recommend plugging the unit into wall outlets near potential leak sources. Ideal locations include the kitchen (near gas stoves), next to gas boilers, near fireplaces, and in the hallways right outside sleeping areas.</p>",
            "page": ""
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "faq_5": {
          "type": "collapsible-row-content",
          "settings": {
            "open": false,
            "heading": "Does it require batteries, hardwiring, or an electrician?",
            "icon": "check_box",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>Not at all. The detector is designed for zero-stress \"Plug & Play\" installation. Simply plug it directly into any standard wall socket. No drilling, no messy wires, and no professional installation required.</p>",
            "page": ""
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "faq_6": {
          "type": "collapsible-row-content",
          "settings": {
            "open": false,
            "heading": "Will the alarm be loud enough to wake my family?",
            "icon": "check_box",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>Absolutely. If gas levels exceed safe thresholds, the device instantly triggers a piercing 85-decibel siren. It is purposely engineered to be extremely loud to wake up heavy sleepers and alert everyone in the household immediately.</p>",
            "page": ""
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "faq_7": {
          "type": "collapsible-row-content",
          "settings": {
            "open": false,
            "heading": "What if I am not completely satisfied with my purchase?",
            "icon": "check_box",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>Your family's safety and your peace of mind are our top priorities. We offer a hassle-free 30-day money-back guarantee. If you don't feel completely secure with your detector, simply return it for a full refund.</p>",
            "page": ""
          },
          "blocks": {}
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "faq_1",
        "faq_2",
        "faq_3",
        "faq_4",
        "faq_5",
        "faq_6",
        "faq_7"
      ],
